					<p>Feel free to send an email directly to my inbox.</p>
					<a href="mailto:cm7887575@gmail.com" class="direct-email">cm7887575@gmail.com</a>
					
					<div class="prof-links">
						<a href="https://github.com/carlos2024r3223rw" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="prof-link">
							GitHub
						</a>
						<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/carlos-manuel-martinez-lima-ba238a1a9/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="prof-link">
